# Build context hygiene: the image needs source, data and the lockfile. Nothing else.
.git
.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
runs
# The attack lab's two index twins. Rebuilt by `make poison` / `make clean-index`
# and about 25MB between them, so there is no reason to hand them to the daemon.
runs-poisoned
runs-clean
# Generated fixtures, and one of them matters: fixtures/models/tiny.pt carries a
# live pickle REDUCE. It is never COPYed into a layer, but a build context is
# still somewhere it has no business being -- and a security lab shipping a
# reduce-carrying pickle into a container build is the joke telling itself.
# `docker compose run --rm scan` regenerates them at runtime.
fixtures
# Presenter material: the deck, the run sheet, the working notes.
presentation
prep
demo
# The browser harness installs its own node_modules and writes screenshots.
uitest/node_modules
uitest/shots
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
CoderCo-Session5-Project-Implementation-Doc.md
docs
.DS_Store
